  "bodyHash": "ac3f6d315e7c3041",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">模組現在終於能正常運作，不過我還是提供了一個數據包版本。</span></p>\n<p>允許透過 Sparse Structures 模組個別設定來自 WDA 的結構。</p>\n<p>當你在遊戲內輸入 /dumpstructuresets 指令時（透過 Sparse Structures），過去你只能獲得次要結構集，此相容模組讓你能夠使用 Sparse Structures 設定每一個獨立結構。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336749/description_721f2dda-c641-4af7-9618-956dc51d10b5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p>此範例來自 Regular Dungeons Arise，Seven Seas 僅包含次要結構。</p>\n<p>次要結構指的是獨角獸戰船（Unicorn Galleon）。</p>\n<p>我需要將此檔案命名與模組相同，以便透過數據包進行覆蓋替換。</p>\n<p>我還為 Regular Dungeons Arise 和 Sparse Structures 開發了另一個獨立的相容模組。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fbooglie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336749/description_19d80d72-a018-4f2f-95dc-c0b4d6257d2f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>如果你財力雄厚，歡迎隨手打賞支持！</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fboogliemys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336749/description_6ae83288-4108-4067-92d4-1f4ba0c6fb18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"336\" height=\"84\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>也歡迎查看我正在開發的恐怖主題整合包 Minescary。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minescary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336749/description_ff0ff09c-06d7-474c-beb3-054f371903da.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"226\">點擊下方橫幅前往我的 YouTube 頻道</strong></span></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLUAVwB7NCWWM5jcDR1OGUa6jcUdQfrjNE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336749/description_9a9baa23-d371-43e3-b25e-98e81b81bcd8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"644\" height=\"129\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1e1f22;color:#bcbec4\">\n<pre style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:9.8pt\">&nbsp;</pre>\n</div>",
